  "text": "NV7000-Q - M.2 SSD - Netac NV7000-Q NV7000-Q 1TB 2TB 4TB • Access to the system in seconds • Compact size for high-density storage • Built with 3D NAND Flash • With an aluminum heat sink • Low power consumption • Intelligent thermal conditioning NV7000-Q M.2 PCIE SSD UP TO 7,100/6,200MB/S SEQUENTIAL READ/WRITE SPEED FEATURE INTEGRATED CASING STRUCTURE With integrated structural design, no moving parts, and vibration and impact resistance, effectively reduces failures and ensures the safety of data storage. WORK WITH PS5 With M.2 280 standard size and single-sided PCB design, it can be used for PS5 built-in expansion, and meet the need for capacity expansion for desktops, notebooks, and other equipment. SATISFYING STORAGE EXPERIENCE With a storage space of 4TB at maximum, it meets the need for large-capacity storage for games, audio and video, and documents. SPECIFICATION Model NV7000-Q Interface M.2 2280 Channel PCIe Gen 4x4 Capacity 1TB/2TB/4TB Seq. Read（MB/s）up to 7,100MB/s Seq. Write（MB/s）up to 6,200MB/s TBW 640 NAND Flash 3D NAND Flash Operating Temperature 0℃-70℃ Storage Temperature -40℃-85℃ Size 80*22*2.3 mm Warranty 5-year NV7000-Q_NETAC_DATA SHEET_EN.pdf",
